QRH Comparator kit
Prepared 2026-10-07 for Joey Messina.

The kit contains no third-party source code. At run time, on the droplet, its scripts download
the following, each at the revision pinned in PINS.env:

  Comparator        https://github.com/leanprover/comparator        Apache-2.0   Lean FRO
  lean4export       https://github.com/leanprover/lean4export       Apache-2.0   Lean FRO
  landrun           https://github.com/zouuup/landrun               MIT          Armin Ranjbar
  Lean 4 (via elan) https://github.com/leanprover/lean4             Apache-2.0
  Go                https://go.dev/                                 BSD-3-Clause (only to build landrun)
  openai/math       https://github.com/openai/math                  Apache-2.0   OpenAI (the artifact under test)
  Mathlib and the other Lean packages OpenAI's manifest names, from their own repositories.

Phase 3 runs Comparator's own regression projects from the Comparator checkout
(tests/projects/); they are not copied into the kit. The five projects in controls/ were written
for this kit.

The launch command follows Comparator's README. The structure of a pinned verification script
was informed by anthropics/formal-math, zeta23/scripts/verify-comparator.sh (Apache-2.0); no
code was taken from it.

bridge/MNF_Bridge78.lean and bridge/MNF_Bridge78_Unconditional.lean belong to the Messina
Nullification Framework corpus.
